                    threat_data:            `Data capability only — we lack the data platform; build it and the rest follows`,
                    box_parameter:          `A design parameter — map which moves are high-risk before designing, so every option clears its gate`,
                    box_obstacle:           `An obstacle bolted on at the end — design the strategy first, handle compliance when we deploy`,
                    box_ignore:             `A formality — IVASS rarely acts fast; move and document later if asked`,

