                    r3_segment_hint:        `A wider exposure with an over-fitted model magnifies young-driver tail risk; a narrow, guardrailed pilot lets you learn before scaling.`,
                    launch_guardrails:      `Launch with guardrails — caps, human-in-the-loop, limited segments, bias testing in flight`,
