                    insight_resilient:      `Modernized within the rules: you solved the transformation as one system — a coherent, milestone-gated path, a guardrailed launch that combined the model and the underwriters, and a dependency-ordered sequence that cleared each gate before go-live. The regulator has nothing, the agents are allies, and capital created real value.`,
                    insight_finding:        `IVASS finding: a high-risk AI move went live without its gate, and the supervisor opened an inquiry — remediation, a Solvency add-on, and the spring season lost anyway. In a regulated industry the compliance gate is part of time-to-market; skipping it bought nothing and cost EUR 12–18M.`,
                    insight_short:          `You didn't fully reconcile the path, the launch and the sequence. They still tell slightly different stories — enough for a dependency to slip, a gate to be missed, or the agents to disengage.`,
                    insight_roi_negative:   `Your ROI is negative: either the agents slow-walked the book, capital stranded behind a slipped dependency, or an unguarded model mis-priced the tail. Transformation value in a distribution-led firm lives or dies on sequencing and the channel.`,
                    insight_roi_strong:     `Strong ROI: a gated, dependency-respecting sequence captured the modernization upside without stranding capital or losing the agent network — value the front-loaded, ungated alternatives only promised.`,
                    insight_ivass:          `You triggered a supervisory finding. A pricing or governance failure converts a commercial misstep into a capital event — the EU AI Act gate and human oversight existed precisely to prevent it.`,
                    insight_agents:         `The agent network disengaged. With 78% of premium flowing through 1,850 agencies, a transformation they experience as a threat is one they can veto — channel-conflict management was a strategic decision, not an afterthought.`,
                    insight_stranded:       `Capital stranded. Committing ahead of milestones meant investment built on a dependency that slipped — the value of milestone-gated release is the option to learn before you scale.`,
                    insight_designparam:    `You turned compliance into a design parameter. The path that treats the regulatory box as part of the opportunity set — not a brake on it — is the one that modernizes and stays supervisable at once. That is Brunetta's central idea, applied.`,
                    grade_modernized:       `Modernized Within the Rules`,
